# @gateway-experience/contracts is published from the Seagull-gateway repo to
# this project's GitLab Package Registry. Replace the two REPLACE_ME values
# below with the numeric project ID of the GitLab project that publishes the
# package; `npm install` fails loudly until you do, which is deliberate — a
# wrong ID would silently resolve to the public registry.
#
#   Project ID: GitLab project page -> Settings -> General -> Project ID
#   Token:      set CI_JOB_TOKEN in CI, or a personal access token with
#               read_api locally. Do NOT commit a token to this file.
#
@gateway-experience:registry=https://gitlab.com/api/v4/projects/86165809/packages/npm/
//gitlab.com/api/v4/projects/86165809/packages/npm/:_authToken=${GITLAB_NPM_TOKEN}
